  environmentText: "8.3 psi (57 kPa) O2 loop \xB7 Reduces pre-breathe overhead for rapid EVA sorties."
  summaryText: Official NASA Mark III prototype suit designed for planetary surface walking, kneeling, and rock coring.
  sourceUrl: https://github.com/nasa/NASA-3D-Resources
